ing the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{5}m+8-\\frac{6}{5}m-3 & = \\\\ (\\frac{2}{5}m-\\frac{6}{5}m)+(8-3) & = \\\\ (\\frac{2-6}{5})m+5 & = \\\\ -\\frac{4}{5}m+5\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186459206 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186138510 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "54498b47-9a43-5b4d-8bbf-806af5968829" :knowledge-point/title "Simplifying Fractions with Like Denominators"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19813603-2ff6-5970-bfa0-a18fe649a92e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y}{4}-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458670} {:answer/id #uuid "2e952626-46ee-5082-8870-a4f12c88b01e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y}{2}+4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458719} {:answer/id #uuid "6224b75f-2ecf-55a0-8d31-a1c8dd965483" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{y}{8}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458797} {:answer/id #uuid "b79d8989-3956-514d-8613-e3f7d9d32e9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y}{8}-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458960} {:answer/id #uuid "ff65897b-ae3f-5dde-b154-c5eaeea76e9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{y}{4}-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459082}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "19813603-2ff6-5970-bfa0-a18fe649a92e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{y}{4}-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186458670} :answer-field/id #uuid "a52eccb8-b500-5312-ae2a-22b1fe553ea4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186459154}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "020fed93-fcd3-5223-ae8a-0e7f2cc99320" :question/math-academy-id "q-51440" :question/problem "$\\frac{y}{8}+7-\\frac{3y}{8}-11=$" :question/worked-solution "We collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{y}{8}+7-\\frac{3y}{8}-11 & = \\\\ (\\frac{y}{8}-\\frac{3y}{8})+(7-11) & = \\\\ (\\frac{y-3y}{8})-4 & = \\\\ -\\frac{2y}{8}-4 & = \\\\ -\\frac{y}{4}-4\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
